{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "先用快慢指针找到前半部分的尾节点，再原地反转后半段，使对应位置可以从两端同时比较。示例 [1,2,2,1] 中，两轮比较均相等，因此返回 true；比较结束后还可以再次反转以恢复链表。整个过程只使用常数个指针，时间复杂度为 O(n)，额外空间复杂度为 O(1)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>回文链表演示</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.step{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-height:52px}\n.node{min-width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.value{padding:2px;text-align:center;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.labels{min-height:18px;padding:2px;text-align:center;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;line-height:1.2;border-top:1px solid #3c3c3c}\n.node.active{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c}\n.node.active .value,.node.active .labels{color:#fff}\n.node.done{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;opacity:.8}\n.arrow{color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px}\n.arrow.reverse{color:#3794ff}\n.explain{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;line-height:1.45;font-size:11px}\n.result{margin-top:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px}\n.result.show{background:#0e639c;color:#fff}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff;vertical-align:-1px}\n.badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.badge{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>回文链表：快慢指针 + 反转</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 <span class=\"mono\">[1,2,2,1]</span></p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"step\" id=\"step\">第 1 步</div>\n<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div>\n<div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></div>\n<div class=\"result\" id=\"result\">判断：等待比较</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>关注节点</span></div>\n<div class=\"badges\"><span class=\"badge\">时间 <span class=\"mono\">O(n)</span></span><span class=\"badge\">空间 <span class=\"mono\">O(1)</span></span></div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst frames = [\n  {title:'第 1 步：初始化快慢指针', order:[0,1,2,3], slow:0, fast:0, active:[0], text:'slow 和 fast 都从头节点出发；fast 每次走两步，slow 每次走一步。'},\n  {title:'第 2 步：快慢指针寻找前半段尾节点', order:[0,1,2,3], slow:1, fast:2, active:[1,2], text:'fast 到达下标 2，slow 到达下标 1。再前进时 fast 将越过链表，因此下标 1 是前半段尾节点。'},\n  {title:'第 3 步：原地反转后半段', order:[0,1,3,2], slow:1, fast:null, active:[2,3], reverse:true, text:'反转后半段: 先令节点 2.next = null, 再令节点 3.next = 节点 2. 最后把 slow.next 接到新头节点 3, 得到图中结构. 只修改 next 指针.'},\n  {title:'第 4 步：比较第 1 对节点', order:[0,1,3,2], left:0, right:3, active:[0,3], reverse:true, done:[], text:'左侧值 1，右侧值 1：相等，两个比较指针同时前进。'},\n  {title:'第 5 步：比较第 2 对节点', order:[0,1,3,2], left:1, right:2, active:[1,2], reverse:true, done:[0,3], text:'左侧值 2，右侧值 2：仍然相等。后半段已经比较完毕。'},\n  {title:'第 6 步：得到结果并恢复链表', order:[0,1,2,3], active:[], done:[0,1,2,3], result:true, text:'所有对应节点的值都相等，所以该链表是回文链表。再次反转后半段, 并将 slow.next 接回节点 2, 恢复原结构.'}\n];\nconst values = [1,2,2,1];\nlet index = 0;\nfunction render(frame) {\n  document.getElementById('step').textContent = frame.title;\n  document.getElementById('explain').textContent = frame.text;\n  const chain = document.getElementById('chain');\n  chain.innerHTML = '';\n  frame.order.forEach((id, pos) => {\n    const node = document.createElement('div');\n    node.className = 'node' + ((frame.active || []).includes(id) ? ' active' : '') + ((frame.done || []).includes(id) ? ' done' : '');\n    const tags = [];\n    if (frame.slow === id) tags.push('slow');\n    if (frame.fast === id) tags.push('fast');\n    if (frame.left === id) tags.push('左');\n    if (frame.right === id) tags.push('右');\n    node.innerHTML = '<div class=\"value\">' + values[id] + '</div><div class=\"labels\">' + id + (tags.length ? '·' + tags.join('/') : '') + '</div>';\n    chain.appendChild(node);\n    if (pos < frame.order.length - 1) {\n      const arrow = document.createElement('span');\n      arrow.className = 'arrow' + (frame.reverse && pos >= 1 ? ' reverse' : '');\n      arrow.textContent = '→';\n      chain.appendChild(arrow);\n    }\n  });\n  const result = document.getElementById('result');\n  result.className = 'result' + (frame.result ? ' show' : '');\n  result.textContent = frame.result ? '判断：true（回文）' : '判断：等待比较';\n}\nrender(frames[0]);\nsetInterval(() => {\n  index = (index + 1) % frames.length;\n  render(frames[index]);\n}, 2200);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
